  "bodyHash": "5cced52715d77f8d",
  "content": "\n\n<p>這是我用 MCreator 為我的整合包製作的第一個模組</p>\n<p>我將持續維護此模組，並新增更多物品、機制與內容</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong>此模組為以下多個模組的擴充套件：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enigmatic-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">enigmatic legacy</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">born in chaos</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iron's spells 'n spellbooks</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sanity-descent-into-madness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sanity</a></strong></h3>\n<p><strong>運行此模組需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">curios api</a></strong></p>\n<p>模組新增內容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>詛咒劍</strong>：擊中生物後，後續攻擊將同時對目標與自身造成傷害&nbsp;\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\" src=\"https://i.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExMG90MDBwNmE1NWV1MG83cmdudnlueTkwM2U5Z2Z6ODJ0dmJsZDFlaSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/akl4Qv9NslkhA0rlNn/giphy.gif\" alt=\"sword attack\" width=\"480\" height=\"254\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>詛咒頭盔</strong>：使所有魔法效果翻倍，但噩夢將追隨你\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExb2p3OWttZXRlajZyMm0yM3I5bzNvajc1enl3OHZud2tpcWV2bGoyNiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/o5PJfp6qQRI6oiN1r1/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"254\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>詛咒胸甲</strong>：將紅色生命轉為黃色靈魂心，消耗食物值與飽食度。允許在空中連續跳躍 5 次並減緩下落速度\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExMDBxb3BvcGFsejV1NDllZWM3bW9pZ3JuMjA2Zmt2Z3FhNGc1dnpucyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/StYpqXzraspW7bHYas/giphy.gif\" alt=\"heart converts\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>詛咒護腿</strong>：每秒移動速度逐漸提升。高速奔跑時會使你燃燒</li>\n<li><strong>詛咒靴子</strong>：提供加速、跳躍高度提升、行動靈活性增強及在細雪中的抗寒能力。增加摔落傷害<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExNnVldm15aXV3Nmc1OTRmYmhwYXgzM2NkcW94Y3p2YWxnc3RmbWgzaiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/HVqKDenTU5y8aNY4ot/giphy-downsized-large.gif\" alt=\"in powder snow\" width=\"376\" height=\"202\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<h6>我想我必須手動重寫模組了，MCreator 畢竟無法實現所有功能）</h6>\n</blockquote>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
